cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Agriculture Atlas software, schemas, or technical documentation, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Agriculture Atlas: Zero-IoT Virtual Agro-Sensor Twins and Offline Zero-Literacy Agronomic Reference Systems for Climate-Vulnerable Smallholder Farming"
abstract: "Agriculture Atlas is a non-commercial, open-science agronomic intelligence initiative that transforms Uber H3 spatial cells into Zero-IoT Virtual Agro-Sensor Twins by coupling deterministic FAO-56 Penman-Monteith agro-physics with an MIT/Apache-2.0 four-SKU foundation model stack on Microsoft Azure NVIDIA GPUs and NVIDIA Brev, paired with sub-5 KB offline delta synchronization and zero-literacy voice-first mobile interfaces for smallholder farmers."
